WEBVTT

00:13:26.629 --> 00:13:31.299
or a new type of AI-powered innovation
that's happening right there?

00:13:31.323 --> 00:13:36.438
KFL: China's venture-capital ecosystem
in the last 15 years

00:13:36.462 --> 00:13:38.085
went from almost nothing

00:13:38.109 --> 00:13:41.585
to similar maturity as in the US.

00:13:41.609 --> 00:13:43.606
And more capital is flowing in,

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:46.506
more venture capitalists
are helping entrepreneurs,

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:49.989
and entrepreneurs are working
on amazing applications.

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:53.591
So we could sort of answer
your question in two ways.

00:13:53.615 --> 00:13:58.532
One is, what are what people
consider AI applications,

00:13:58.556 --> 00:14:00.506
how are they taking off,